{"seq":1,"slug":"move-semantics","title":"移动语义与右值引用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpp-fundamentals/cpp-modern/move-semantics","wordCount":1030,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"移动语义与右值引用\">移动语义与右值引用</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>移动语义（Move Semantics）是 C++11 引入的最重要的语言特性之一，它通过区分「需要保留的值」（左值）和「即将消亡的值」（右值），允许编译器在安全的前提下「窃取」临时对象的资源，避免不必要的深拷贝。右值引用（T&amp;&amp;）是移动语义的语法基础，std::move 和 std::forward 是其核心工具。移动语义让 C++ 在保持值语义的同时达到接近指针传递的性能。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[表达式] --&gt; B[左值 lvalue]&#10;    A --&gt; C[右值 rvalue]&#10;    C --&gt; D[纯右值 prvalue]&#10;    C --&gt; E[将亡值 xvalue]&#10;    B --&gt; F[有名字、可取地址]&#10;    D --&gt; G[字面量、临时对象]&#10;    E --&gt; H[std::move 的结果]&#10;    F --&gt; I[T&amp; 左值引用绑定]&#10;    G --&gt; J[T&amp;&amp; 右值引用绑定]&#10;    H --&gt; J\">graph TD\n    A[表达式] --&gt; B[左值 lvalue]\n    A --&gt; C[右值 rvalue]\n    C --&gt; D[纯右值 prvalue]\n    C --&gt; E[将亡值 xvalue]\n    B --&gt; F[有名字、可取地址]\n    D --&gt; G[字面量、临时对象]\n    E --&gt; H[std::move 的结果]\n    F --&gt; I[T&amp; 左值引用绑定]\n    G --&gt; J[T&amp;&amp; 右值引用绑定]\n    H --&gt; J</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>值类别</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>可取地址</th>\n<th>可移动</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>左值 lvalue</td>\n<td>有持久标识的表达式</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否（除非 std::move）</td>\n<td>变量名、*ptr、str[0]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纯右值 prvalue</td>\n<td>产生临时值的表达式</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>42、std::string(&quot;hi&quot;)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>将亡值 xvalue</td>\n<td>即将消亡的左值</td>\n<td>是（技术上）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>std::move(x)、函数返回 T&amp;&amp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"移动构造与移动赋值\">移动构造与移动赋值</h2><p>移动构造函数和移动赋值运算符是移动语义的实现载体。当源对象是右值时，编译器会优先调用移动版本而非拷贝版本，通过「窃取」源对象的内部资源（如动态内存、文件句柄）来避免深拷贝。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"#include &lt;cstring&gt;&#10;#include &lt;utility&gt;&#10;#include &lt;algorithm&gt;&#10;&#10;class DynamicBuffer {&#10;public:&#10;    explicit DynamicBuffer(std::size_t size)&#10;        : data_(new char[size]), size_(size), capacity_(size) {&#10;        std::memset(data_, 0, size_);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    ~DynamicBuffer() { delete[] data_; }&#10;&#10;    DynamicBuffer(const DynamicBuffer&amp; other)&#10;        : data_(new char[other.size_]), size_(other.size_), capacity_(other.size_) {&#10;        std::memcpy(data_, other.data_, size_);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    DynamicBuffer(DynamicBuffer&amp;&amp; other) noexcept&#10;        : data_(other.data_), size_(other.size_), capacity_(other.capacity_) {&#10;        other.data_ = nullptr;&#10;        other.size_ = 0;&#10;        other.capacity_ = 0;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    auto operator=(const DynamicBuffer&amp; other) -&gt; DynamicBuffer&amp; {&#10;        if (this != &amp;other) {&#10;            auto* newData = new char[other.size_];&#10;            std::memcpy(newData, other.data_, other.size_);&#10;            delete[] data_;&#10;            data_ = newData;&#10;            size_ = other.size_;&#10;            capacity_ = other.size_;&#10;        }&#10;        return *this;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    auto operator=(DynamicBuffer&amp;&amp; other) noexcept -&gt; DynamicBuffer&amp; {&#10;        if (this != &amp;other) {&#10;            delete[] data_;&#10;            data_ = other.data_;&#10;            size_ = other.size_;&#10;            capacity_ = other.capacity_;&#10;            other.data_ = nullptr;&#10;            other.size_ = 0;&#10;            other.capacity_ = 0;&#10;        }&#10;        return *this;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    auto size() const -&gt; std::size_t { return size_; }&#10;&#10;private:&#10;    char* data_;&#10;    std::size_t size_;&#10;    std::size_t capacity_;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;cstring><